    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        "Notice that the way the Alaska multipolygon is plotted under the NAD83/EPSG:4269 CRS separates the islands and unnaturally elongates the map. \n",
        "To fix this, we will reproject the Alaska geo-dataframe to the EPSG:3338 CRS. \n",
        "This CRS is a *projected* CRS, better suited for working with data from Alaska:\n",
        "\n",
        "![Source: [spatialreference.org](https://spatialreference.org/ref/epsg/3338/)](/book/images/lesson-13/epsg_3338.png)"
