    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        "This dataset has the EPSG:4326 CRS. Remember this is the EPSG code for the WGS 84 CRS. \n",
        "This is not a surprise since the places data is global and EPSG:4326/WGS84 is the most widely used CRS for such data.\n",
        "\n",
        "Let's see what happens when we try to plot this data on top of Alaska:"
      ],
      "id": "04c977f1"
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        "# Trouble\n",
        "fig, ax = plt.subplots()\n",
        "\n",
        "alaska.plot(ax=ax)\n",
        "places.plot(ax=ax, color='red')\n",
        "\n",
        "plt.show()"
      ],
